WEBVTT

00:18.870 --> 00:20.770
I didn't make it in time.

00:28.250 --> 00:29.710
Gunner's Broom.

02:33.000 --> 02:35.340
To my beloved Oji-sama.

02:35.890 --> 02:39.760
There is a new student in my class today.

02:39.760 --> 02:43.050
It's just that... this classmate is...

02:45.200 --> 02:49.390
Kureha-san's childhood friend, Hiiragi-senpai.

02:54.770 --> 03:01.320
Due to some curriculum problem, the third year student, Hiiragi-kun, will from today onwards be a second year student.

03:01.320 --> 03:06.030
Though he is older than all of you,
please treat him as one of yourselves.

03:06.870 --> 03:10.230
So that's Hiiragi the "dropped student" that everyone's been talking about, huh?

03:10.230 --> 03:13.210
I heard that he failed last year too.

03:13.210 --> 03:20.800
Oji-sama, it's my fault that Hiiragi-senpai ended up like this.

03:26.520 --> 03:30.430
What is your request?

03:30.430 --> 03:35.360
Before that, let's talk about the world you live in right now, and its current condition.

03:35.760 --> 03:37.260
The world?

03:38.280 --> 03:40.250
Listen well, Elis-san.

03:40.250 --> 03:44.510
There is another world called "Rikai" that exists on Earth.

03:44.510 --> 03:51.260
And the people of Rikai are searching for machines in order to invade the surface world.

03:51.260 --> 03:55.000
In other words, they are targeting this world.

03:58.760 --> 04:00.630
Let me give you a more concrete example.

04:01.150 --> 04:09.000
Dragons, minotaurs, Medusa, Nospheratu and demons that were told in myths and legends.

04:09.000 --> 04:16.710
All of these creatures that we think are created from fiction are actually the invaders from Rikai, the Emulators.

04:16.710 --> 04:17.860
Emulators?

04:20.870 --> 04:22.010
That's me!

04:22.010 --> 04:23.030
You taped us?!

04:23.490 --> 04:28.990
An Emulator cannot be harmed by the power you call science.

04:28.990 --> 04:34.290
The ones who have the power to go against them... are Wizards.

04:34.670 --> 04:35.960
Wizards?

04:45.320 --> 04:47.420
You are also one of them...

04:47.420 --> 04:48.240
Elis-san.

04:49.080 --> 04:52.350
That bracelet you have on your left hand.

04:52.770 --> 04:56.010
That is a Broom in the form of a bracelet.

04:56.010 --> 04:58.020
It's the proof that you are a Wizard.

04:58.020 --> 04:59.270
Broom...

04:59.270 --> 05:01.230
That's right. Try praying to it.

05:01.750 --> 05:03.940
Say "Protect me."

05:04.820 --> 05:06.000
Protect...

05:14.050 --> 05:18.750
"Eyes of Wand." Elis-san, that is the name of your Broom.

05:25.000 --> 05:27.490
I am... a Wizard?

05:27.490 --> 05:31.470
You also possess a "Kaguya" now that you have been reawakened as a Wizard.

05:31.470 --> 05:33.000
Something like this.

05:39.760 --> 05:42.380
That's not some kind of trick is it?

05:42.380 --> 05:49.010
Kaguya intercept ones common sense, its a personal space, so you can also store weapons in it.

05:50.290 --> 05:51.770
You'll get used to it in no time.

05:53.000 --> 05:56.100
Now then, let's get back to the main point of our story.

05:56.100 --> 06:01.500
About a year ago, we received a hint that Emulators will be appearing in this world unlike what we've ever seen before.

06:02.510 --> 06:07.870
Even in the long history of the human race, this truly is a rare occurrence.

06:07.870 --> 06:11.720
I was called upon three times today.

06:11.720 --> 06:14.010
The war is worsening by the day.

06:14.490 --> 06:21.230
Normal humans may not realize it yet, but the world right now is truly on the verge of destruction.

06:21.610 --> 06:28.410
Seeing this, I, as the protector of the world, have come up with a plan to counterattack the Rikai.

06:28.410 --> 06:33.200
In other words, I'm going to sever the dangerous beehive itself.

06:33.530 --> 06:38.500
It's just that in order to do that, I will need to open a door to "Rikai" from this world.

06:39.000 --> 06:43.500
And the only one who can make that possible is you, Elis-san.

06:44.260 --> 06:45.670
Me?

06:48.800 --> 06:51.000
Elis-san, give me your left hand.

06:51.000 --> 06:52.250
Okay.

06:53.230 --> 06:55.140
This is the "Jewel of Kindness".

06:55.140 --> 06:59.850
It's one of the Jewels of the Seven Virtues that fell onto Earth a long long time ago.

07:00.230 --> 07:02.110
Jewel of the Seven Virtues?

07:09.660 --> 07:11.470
The Jewels of Seven Virtues...

07:11.470 --> 07:17.950
appeared on many occasions throughout history, and they even tried to destroy the world on one of them.

07:17.950 --> 07:21.730
Why are such things attracted to my bracelet?

07:21.730 --> 07:24.780
That is because you are the chosen one.

07:24.780 --> 07:29.510
Inside you lies the power to detect and collect these jewels.

07:30.080 --> 07:36.470
Once all of the seven jewels are bound to the bracelet, you can open the door to Rikai.

07:36.830 --> 07:41.300
In other words, you hold the key to saving the world in your hands.

07:41.300 --> 07:43.980
I... will save... the world?

07:44.390 --> 07:47.510
That's right, you will save the world.

07:47.510 --> 07:48.940
You will become the key.

07:55.210 --> 07:57.530
Now then, let's get back to the main topic.

07:57.530 --> 08:02.500
Please answer the request which I am going to ask you with either "Okay" or "Yes."

08:03.010 --> 08:06.010
Will you collect the remaining six jewels for me?

08:06.530 --> 08:08.880
You will accept this mission, won't you, Elis-san?

08:09.630 --> 08:10.590
Yes!

08:11.460 --> 08:12.670
Elis-chan?!

08:12.670 --> 08:13.680
That's way too fast!

08:14.250 --> 08:17.260
This is by no means a simple task.

08:17.260 --> 08:24.110
The Greater Devil Bell Zephyr will try to stop you from collecting the jewels by sending out waves of Emulators.

08:24.110 --> 08:26.190
Even so, I won't change my answer.

08:26.190 --> 08:27.060
It's a yes.

08:28.520 --> 08:32.720
I've worn this bracelet ever since I was born.

08:32.720 --> 08:36.740
Yet, no one told me why I had it on me.

08:37.470 --> 08:41.820
But this is the first time I've understood the meaning of owning this bracelet.

08:41.820 --> 08:45.500
If there's anything that I can do for this world, I'll do it!

08:50.090 --> 08:51.810
Understood.

08:51.810 --> 08:58.020
This means that... Hiiragi-san's and Kureha-san's mission... will be protecting Elis-san.

08:58.020 --> 08:58.760
Okay!

08:59.220 --> 09:00.450
Kureha too?!

09:00.450 --> 09:03.420
What are you saying Hiiragi? Are you saying that I'm unreliable?

09:03.420 --> 09:05.430
No, that's not what I meant...

09:05.430 --> 09:08.400
I can give away your secret you know...

09:09.010 --> 09:10.010
Secret?

09:10.010 --> 09:13.760
Elis-chan, Elis-chan, I am the only who knows about this...

09:13.760 --> 09:14.720
Hiiragi is actually...

09:14.720 --> 09:16.940
Wait, wait, wait!!

09:16.940 --> 09:18.880
Kureha, I'm counting on you!!

09:18.880 --> 09:21.360
Let's get the job done together!!

09:21.360 --> 09:26.580
Although he may look like a useless brat,
Hiiragi is actually a very skilled swordsman.

09:27.070 --> 09:29.390
Use him all you want!

09:29.390 --> 09:30.540
O-Okay...

09:30.540 --> 09:36.820
Hiiragi-san, you will be placed to protect Elis-san 24 hours a day.

09:36.820 --> 09:40.760
What? Even if you say that, I still have classes and my private life.

09:41.460 --> 09:42.860
No problem.

09:42.860 --> 09:46.810
I have already talked with Kimei Academy about it.

09:47.520 --> 09:49.740
D-Don't tell me...

09:54.540 --> 09:59.120
I'd understand if someone had to repeat a year, but I have never seen someone being dropped a year.

09:59.120 --> 10:01.070
Maybe he's an idiot.

10:01.390 --> 10:08.750
Oji-sama, I'll work hard so that Hiiragi-senpai can get back to the third year as soon as possible.

10:14.520 --> 10:18.550
Wow! Look at all the space!!

10:18.550 --> 10:23.260
Akihabara's first class mansion, and on the top floor too!

10:23.260 --> 10:25.800
Not to mention it is close to school.

10:25.800 --> 10:27.540
There's nothing to complain about for this place.

10:27.540 --> 10:31.650
It's too spacious for me to live alone.

10:33.490 --> 10:37.070
But since I'll be living with you from now on...

10:44.440 --> 10:50.870
Though Anzelotte asked me to protect you; living together, that's very pushy.

10:50.870 --> 10:56.560
Ah, about my sleeping area, I don't mind sleeping on the cou-!!

11:00.370 --> 11:01.640
Your place is outside!

11:01.640 --> 11:04.450
That hurts!! Hey! This is the balcony!!

11:07.950 --> 11:09.020
Hey, you!

11:12.550 --> 11:17.190
Damn her, who does she take me for?!

11:17.730 --> 11:19.900
Hiiragi! Time for food!

11:21.340 --> 11:23.260
I'm not your pet!!

11:23.990 --> 11:26.240
I'm just kidding.

11:26.240 --> 11:27.740
Hiiragi-senpai!

11:28.260 --> 11:31.540
That's the call, let's have dinner together.

11:32.100 --> 11:35.960
Party... to celebrate the formation of our party?

11:35.960 --> 11:38.110
Such a great plan, don't you think?

11:38.110 --> 11:40.280
Now that we're living together from now on.

11:40.280 --> 11:42.240
We need to deepen our friendship, right?

11:42.240 --> 11:44.260
Take a seat...

11:44.260 --> 11:45.350
Hiiragi-senpai.

11:48.520 --> 11:53.540
Now now, here's to the party that is going to save the world! Cheers!!

11:53.540 --> 11:54.540
Cheers!

11:54.540 --> 11:55.360
Oh...

11:57.030 --> 11:58.670
This is delicious!

11:58.670 --> 12:00.430
Did you make this all by yourself?

12:00.430 --> 12:03.640
No, Kureha-san lent me a hand as well.

12:03.640 --> 12:06.320
Yes, like washing the vegetables.

12:08.570 --> 12:13.540
Ah, this tomato and onion tart tastes good!

12:13.540 --> 12:17.850
It's not a cake yet it tastes like one but it's not a cake...

12:17.850 --> 12:21.290
I always made them when I was at the orphanage.

12:21.290 --> 12:26.850
Even the kids who hated vegetables said it was delicious and ate it.

12:34.000 --> 12:35.520
This is surprisingly good.

12:37.010 --> 12:40.200
If you'd like, please taste the pumpkin pudding.

12:40.200 --> 12:42.000
Ah, I am confident about that one.

12:42.000 --> 12:43.980
You made it?!

12:57.210 --> 12:59.560
Ah, everything is in English...

13:03.700 --> 13:07.060
Elis-chan, I didn't know you could read English books.

13:07.060 --> 13:08.330
You're amazing!

13:08.330 --> 13:11.240
No, this book is like a charm to me.

13:11.240 --> 13:12.480
A charm?

13:12.480 --> 13:14.450
I've already told you about it before.

13:14.450 --> 13:17.250
There is a man who helps me from afar.

13:17.250 --> 13:20.360
Ah, that's right, you did say that you have someone who's like a father to you, right?

13:20.770 --> 13:25.200
Yes, but I have never met him.

13:25.200 --> 13:28.360
Just like the protagonist of this book, Judy Abbot.

13:25.200 --> 13:30.000
Note: Jerusha "Judy" Abbot is the main character in Jean Webster's novel <i>Daddy Long Legs.</i>

13:28.360 --> 13:33.270
I've always hoped that I could meet him someday.

13:33.270 --> 13:37.860
And finally, we could meet on my upcoming seventeenth birthday.

13:38.650 --> 13:40.200
That's great!

13:40.200 --> 13:44.220
Okay, then we need to collect all of those jewels as quickly as possible.

13:44.220 --> 13:46.840
Let's set our target as your seventeenth birthday.

13:49.020 --> 13:50.050
Yes!

13:53.290 --> 13:58.000
Oji-sama, I have become one of the people who will save this world.

13:58.000 --> 14:01.610
I bet you don't understand what I am saying even if I told you.

14:01.610 --> 14:05.020
At any rate, I will work hard.

14:05.020 --> 14:08.950
I'd be happy even if you could only understand that.

14:10.090 --> 14:12.740
Good night, Oji-sama.

14:17.870 --> 14:21.220
You wrap the film around the copper wire like this.

14:21.220 --> 14:23.010
And heat it up.

14:23.010 --> 14:24.320
And then...

14:25.760 --> 14:28.420
the flame turns green, right?

14:28.830 --> 14:33.390
Due to the presence of chlorine in the wrapping foil, the copper turned into metallic salt.

14:33.390 --> 14:37.480
And the result is what we just saw now.

14:37.480 --> 14:39.060
Theoretically...

14:44.020 --> 14:47.800
This omelet is so soft and delicious.

14:47.800 --> 14:50.200
This salted rice ball is delicious too!

14:50.570 --> 14:52.460
Please eat all you want.

14:52.460 --> 14:54.370
Ah, I brought Miso soup as well.

14:59.320 --> 15:01.450
How thoughtful of you!

15:01.450 --> 15:04.000
Looks like you got used to this in just one night, huh?

15:04.840 --> 15:07.780
Anzelotte-san still hasn't contacted us yet?

15:07.780 --> 15:12.720
Yeah, we can't move as long as we don't know the whereabouts of the other six jewels.

15:12.720 --> 15:18.250
I guess even a World Protector's missing something.

15:18.890 --> 15:23.500
But that Anzelotte-san is amazing for such a young girl.

15:23.500 --> 15:28.700
No, her appearance might be that of a kid, but she's quite the old hag.

15:28.700 --> 15:29.730
Old... hag?

15:29.730 --> 15:30.860
Hiiragi-san!!

15:32.450 --> 15:37.660
You were saying something totally rude about me just now, right?!

15:36.130 --> 15:37.410
Oh shit!

15:40.540 --> 15:45.460
I'll take only you, Hiiragi-san, on a special route to my castle!

15:45.460 --> 15:46.840
W-Wait!!

15:47.250 --> 15:49.480
My class!!

15:49.480 --> 15:54.760
Elis-sama, Kureha-sama, we've acquired the whereabouts of the second jewel.

15:54.760 --> 15:55.600
Let's go.

15:56.160 --> 15:57.220
Okay.

15:58.520 --> 16:01.140
The tea today is from Knillworth.

16:01.140 --> 16:05.860
A sweet tea with moderate thickness, perfect for afternoon tea.

16:07.170 --> 16:08.400
Its delicious.

16:08.400 --> 16:10.320
The smell is enchanting.

16:10.320 --> 16:12.690
Hey! Tell us the location quickly!

16:12.690 --> 16:15.290
This is why Hiiragi-san is so boring.

16:15.290 --> 16:16.160
Shut up!

16:17.040 --> 16:21.660
Please answer the request which I am going to ask you with either "Okay" or "Yes."

16:21.660 --> 16:22.650
Yes!

16:22.650 --> 16:25.630
Elis-chan, we still haven't heard what the mission is about yet.

16:26.040 --> 16:30.670
The second jewel is in the legendary continent, Magallanica.

16:31.270 --> 16:33.360
Mega...lanica?

16:33.360 --> 16:34.380
What the hell is that?

16:34.380 --> 16:38.260
Another wizard will be added into your party afterwards as a backup.

16:38.260 --> 16:43.770
The wizard is still on a mission; once she is done, she will meet up with you.

16:43.770 --> 16:46.100
Elis-san, will you go?

16:46.760 --> 16:48.060
Yes!

16:55.210 --> 16:59.520
Oji-sama, at last I am going on my first mission.

17:04.760 --> 17:08.880
I'll work hard, in order to save the world from danger.

17:25.370 --> 17:28.630
This is the legendary continent?

17:32.760 --> 17:34.390
They're so cute!

17:34.390 --> 17:36.990
This is the first time I've seen a real penguin!

17:37.430 --> 17:42.200
The hell with that legendary thing anyway, all I'm seeing is the South Pole.

17:42.200 --> 17:48.190
That makes me wonder, we're wearing clothes this thin, yet I'm not feeling cold.

17:48.190 --> 17:52.430
Ah, you see, that's because the Kaguya is protecting you.

17:52.430 --> 17:53.900
Is that so?

17:53.900 --> 17:56.200
Kaguya are really useful.

17:56.200 --> 17:59.580
More importantly, what is this Magallanica anyway?

17:59.580 --> 18:02.600
Hiiragi, didn't you hear what Anzelotte said?

18:03.040 --> 18:04.640
It is said that there was a huge civilization...

18:04.640 --> 18:09.010
on a huge continent at the southern hemisphere during the Old Greek period.

18:09.010 --> 18:11.400
That is the Magallanica continent.

18:11.400 --> 18:17.000
Magallanica was also written on the globe passed down from the Shoutoku Taishi era in Japan.

18:17.000 --> 18:19.070
That all sounds too fishy.

18:19.510 --> 18:22.510
A Wizard musn't be caught with common sense.

18:22.510 --> 18:25.460
Magallanica definitely exists.

18:25.460 --> 18:28.500
This bracelet is saying so.

18:30.380 --> 18:34.050
Magallanica does exist. Over there, can you see?

18:44.510 --> 18:46.520
W-What?!!

18:50.730 --> 18:53.650
Those are the Magallanica ruins, we found them!

18:54.000 --> 18:55.620
Let's go, Elis-chan!

18:55.620 --> 18:56.490
Yes!

18:58.440 --> 19:00.280
Are you serious?!

19:05.580 --> 19:08.640
It looks like there is a jewel at the South Pole.

19:08.640 --> 19:11.000
It's not the South Pole, it's Magallanica.

19:11.520 --> 19:14.250
Who cares about its name?

19:14.250 --> 19:16.670
Larlam, did you hear what I said just now?

19:17.530 --> 19:19.260
Yes, Bell-sama.

19:19.260 --> 19:21.520
Go and take the jewel, will you?

19:21.520 --> 19:25.010
That or kill that Elis kid.

19:25.010 --> 19:27.090
That's right, either way works.

19:27.090 --> 19:28.980
As you wish.

19:30.250 --> 19:36.470
Leon, do you want to make a bet with me as to whether or not that Elis kid will get the second jewel?

19:36.470 --> 19:38.230
Are you asking me?

19:38.230 --> 19:41.200
Hey, you can't peek inside the book.

19:41.200 --> 19:44.870
Because this is a game.

19:59.520 --> 20:04.760
Inside you lies the power to detect and collect these jewels.

20:06.450 --> 20:09.970
This headache is what Anzelotte-san meant by that?

20:09.970 --> 20:12.220
Elis-chan, is something wrong?

20:12.220 --> 20:15.000
Ah, it's nothing.

20:15.000 --> 20:16.630
Let's hurry up then.

20:20.000 --> 20:27.260
Kill that kid, or get the jewel, I wonder which is easier?

20:33.000 --> 20:35.420
Hiiragi, it's the red moon!

20:37.590 --> 20:39.170
So they've come to get in our way, huh?

20:43.840 --> 20:44.760
Emulator!

20:53.470 --> 20:54.770
A golem?!

20:54.770 --> 20:56.360
Get back, Elis!

20:56.360 --> 20:57.310
Ye-Yes!

20:57.310 --> 20:58.690
BOWTEX!!

21:01.280 --> 21:03.400
This guy is hard!!

21:04.160 --> 21:05.990
ENCHANT FLAME!!

21:31.390 --> 21:32.350
Elis-chan!

21:36.440 --> 21:38.260
Elis!!

22:16.140 --> 22:18.770
I-It disappeared...

22:18.770 --> 22:20.020
Golems...

22:20.020 --> 22:21.860
their weak point is the letters on their foreheads.

22:23.010 --> 22:25.480
Hiiragi Renji, you good-for-nothing.

22:28.950 --> 22:30.240
Akari!

22:30.240 --> 22:33.070
So you're our auxillary support, Akari?

22:33.070 --> 22:37.510
That uniform... is she... a Kimei Academy student?

22:37.510 --> 22:39.610
Yes. 2nd year 3rd class.

22:39.610 --> 22:41.130
The same class as ours.

22:41.130 --> 22:44.990
Hiiragi Renji, you've dropped a year again, haven't you?

22:44.990 --> 22:47.010
As expected from the "dropped student".

22:47.010 --> 22:48.340
Stop calling me that!

22:48.770 --> 22:52.000
Ah, looks like they gained a new member.

22:52.000 --> 22:55.390
But what if I do this?

23:04.480 --> 23:05.690
There are so many of them!

23:13.130 --> 23:15.880
Oji-sama... I...

24:50.800 --> 24:52.000
Oji-sama, we're in trouble!

24:52.000 --> 24:55.640
A terrible thing is waiting for us inside Magallanica Temple.

24:55.640 --> 24:57.510
The two fires that protect the jewel.

24:57.510 --> 25:01.770
And in front of us stands the witch Larlam.

25:01.770 --> 25:04.060
Akari-chan, Kureha-san, do your best!

25:04.560 --> 25:06.650
Hiiragi-senpai, behind you, behind you!

25:07.010 --> 25:12.010
Next time on Night Wizard THE ANIMATION, The Two Fires, Fall Down Magallanica.

25:12.010 --> 25:14.320
Shit, why am I the only one who has to stand for this?!
